# JMR Squared Attribution — Hard Requirement

Every customer-facing website from this template **must** show JMR Squared attribution and a similar-site contact line. Removing or hiding it is a failure condition.

## Required content (exact intent)

1. Attribute the demo to **https://tech.jmrsquared.com/** (link must be live and visible).
2. Include a clear message: if you want a similar website, email **tech@jmrsquared.com** (mailto link).
3. State that this is an **unsolicited demo preview**, not the official business website, unless they choose to keep it.

## Required implementation

- Keep and render `src/shared/components/JmrSquaredAttribution.tsx` and `DemoPreviewBanner`.
- Mount both site-wide on every public page.
- Keep config in `src/shared/config/attribution.ts` and `src/shared/config/demo-preview.ts`.
- Style to match the premium design, but do not obscure (no zero opacity, off-screen hide, or `display:none`).

## Forbidden

- Removing the attribution or demo banner
- Replacing the studio URL or email with another agency
- Making the credit conditional, behind a click, or present only in source comments
- Shipping without a visible similar-website email CTA

## Done check

A reviewer must see, without hunting:

- Demo preview banner with unsolicited/demo wording
- A working link to `https://tech.jmrsquared.com/`
- Visible copy inviting similar-website requests via `tech@jmrsquared.com`
